{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaInn-4933": "INNKEEPER: 您好，您是来看月光蝶的吗？要是的话，我们可以一早叫醒您。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaInn-4934": "INNKEEPER: 住一晚只要一百五十瓦尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaInn-4935": "在旅馆休息",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaInn-4936": "Innkeeper: 您的钱还差点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaInn-4937": "不了，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeBoy1-4938": "BOY: 那个……（悄声耳语）……怎么说？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeBoy1-4939": "BOY: 他们这里的奥斯伦语，我学得比爸爸还快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaGirl1-4940": "GIRL: 哈哈，这可不能告诉你！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaGirl1-4941": "GIRL: 你的词尾还是全用错了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeOldman-4942": "OLD MAN: 又有幸存者来了！要找贝克医生的话，他在旅馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeOldman-4943": "OLD MAN: 又是你？那仗快打完了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeOldman-4944": "OLD MAN: 蝴蝶？通常清早才能看见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-hWoman1-4945": "WOMAN: 要留在这里，就搬个草捆或木桶，帮忙干活！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-hWoman1-4946": "WOMAN: 这些雷津人虽然不太会干农活，可缝补衣服、修理东西，有些人倒是很拿手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-hWoman1-4947": "WOMAN: 月光蝶？我们这儿不这么叫，不过确实有，天刚亮就成群飞出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-farmCoordinator-4948": "FARMER: 挥镰刀的活儿就不用城里人帮忙了，你们搬搬草捆就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-farmCoordinator-4949": "FARMER: 大家抱怨这些新来的人，可人家把一辆卡车改成了拖拉机。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-farmCoordinator-4950": "FARMER: 蝴蝶？当然有，每天早上都来，说实话，还挺烦的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralFarmer-4951": "MAN: 不，不，我可是在农场长大的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralFarmer-4952": "MAN: 这一带的土里石头多，好在从不闹旱灾，天气也不会太热。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralFarmer-4953": "MAN: 蝴蝶？发光的那种？见过几只，不过都在一大早。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-sInnWoman-4954": "WOMAN: 怎么都比睡地上强。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-sInnMan-4955": "MAN: 这里还在用老式塔勒金币。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-sInnMan-4956": "MAN: 幸好，他们也很愿意以物易物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaExitman-4957": "MAN: 从这里顺坡下去，就到西部平原。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaExitman-4958": "MAN: 哦，月蛾？对，现在正是时候，天一亮就能看见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaRunner1-4959": "GIRL: 又可以到处跑了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-sRunner1-4960": "GIRL: 我要跑第一！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-hRunner2-4961": "BOY: 才不是！我会赢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaGranny-4962": "OLD LADY: 不管孩子们从哪儿来，看他们玩，我就高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaStallman-4963": "MAN: 这生意，何止是红火啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnKid1-4964": "BOY: 什么时候能回城里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnKid2-4965": "GIRL: 这里有太多活儿要干了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnKid3-4966": "BOY: 他们答应了，打扫完就给我一整条面包！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnKid3-4967": "BOY: 怎么连饺子都不会包？又没多难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaNanny-4968": "WOMAN: 怎么现在要照看的孩子反而更多了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnLadyC-4969": "OLD WOMAN: 只要你们能收拾干净，想睡哪儿都行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnLadyB-4970": "WOMAN: 至少现在不会再被雨淋醒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnLadyA-4971": "WOMAN: 我觉得自己撑不住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barnManA-4972": "MAN: 衣服洗勤些，就不会有臭虫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaMaid1-4973": "MAID: 应该已经有人告诉您，房间还没准备好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaMaidB-4974": "MAID: 不是来帮忙添毛巾的话，您还是先去别处吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaTrader2-4975": "YOUNG MAN: 要是这仗打到下个冬天，毛皮价钱就要上天了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaTrader1-4976": "MAN: 我看奥斯伦人更可能扣下商队，哪会让我们去做生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaTrader3-4977": "MAN: 商队再不出发，我就得啃皮鞋了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarbA-4978": "BARBARIAN: 这些人要是还不从我们的猎场滚出去……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarbB-4979": "BARBARIAN: 这可不好说，我刚拿一头麋鹿换了三磅盐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarbC-4980": "BARBARIAN: 该死的奥斯伦战争……妹妹生孩子，我都没法回去陪着她了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarbC-4981": "BARBARIAN: 现在卢斯基亚人也封了山谷，以前还肯放我们过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarb3-4982": "BARBARIAN: 明天就要花光金子了，得再去打猎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarb2-4983": "BARBARIAN: 阿平戈里克斯？见过，不过他不会跑到这么靠西的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarb1-4984": "BARBARIAN: 我跟阿平戈里克斯一起劫掠过一次，他太疯了，我可受不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaHostess-4985": "HOSTESS: 难民和毛皮商人都困在这里，床位快没了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaHostess-4986": "HOSTESS: 又见面了！最近空位多了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaHostess-4987": "HOSTESS: 蝴蝶？想看的话，我们会早早叫醒您。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaEntryBarb-4988": "BARBARIAN: 阿平戈里克斯？不，他不是我们部落的，我们也不喜欢他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-strallinn1-4989": "MAN: 真希望我儿子也能活着到这里……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-strallinn1-4990": "MAN: 村里人真是热心，尤其跟他们在奥斯伦的亲族一比，就更难得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn2-4991": "WOMAN: 我丈夫，他……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn2-4992": "WOMAN: 儿子一天天地越来越像他爸爸了，我真的好想他爸爸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn3-4993": "GIRL: 我们现在就住这里了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn4-4994": "BOY: 再看见奥斯伦人，我就一拳打他脸上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn5-4995": "OLD MAN: 我辛辛苦苦攒了一辈子的家当，奥斯伦人只用一天，就给我烧了个精光。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralinn5-4996": "OLD MAN: 贝克医生和那个年轻助手又回去找难民了，希望他们一切顺利。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-mateusz-4997": "MATEUSZ: 无论去哪儿，都祝你好运，真的。那件事不是你的错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBekker-4998": "BEKKER: 记住，就算你比那些发动战争的人更残暴，也结束不了这场战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-thermeinnA-4999": "WOMAN: 再也不会见到这样的事了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-thermeinnB-5000": "MAN: 这么多外国人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-thermeinnB-5001": "MAN: 那些外来人越来越自在，我可不喜欢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralShopper-5002": "WOMAN: 除了酸菜，我一样都认不出……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralShopper-5003": "WOMAN: 我教了本地人几道雷津菜，可大多数人都不敢尝新东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-stralShopper-5004": "WOMAN: 哦，蝴蝶？早上一起来，到处都是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaShopper-5005": "MAN: 从农场走了一天才到这里，他们却什么都缺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaShopper-5006": "MAN: 店里多了些没见过的货，是那些新来的人托卢斯基亚的亲戚弄来的吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-barbShopper1-5007": "BARBARIAN: 要不是每年都得回来，我们早抢了这地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-furShopper1-5008": "TRAPPER: 你们偏偏这时候来，是好是坏，我也说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-furShopper1-5009": "TRAPPER: 至少店里还有货。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaOldy2-5010": "MAN: 能活着晒到太阳，就很高兴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-refugeeBarnDoor-5011": "MAN: 多数人只能睡谷仓，不过至少有屋顶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaOldy-5012": "MAN: 农民再老，也总能干点活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter8/helvaNpcs.yarn-helvaBarb4-5013": "BARBARIAN: 这里的啤酒比我们自己酿的好多了，可钱也花得真快。"
}
